eived a report that the princess of Béarn in southwest France sought to send Lutherans into Spain as missionaries. By 1578 Inquisition officials had learned that Protestants had printed heretical copies of the New Testament in Castilian, with intentions to circulate the texts in Iberia." '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 888, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 826})
